    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Jérémy Levasseur",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108476768351386656636/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocISVC8-m93gCVScm1yjb8xwbGgy7mywRtBMq1jHUOIGLCPPHA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "Amazing service and quality of work! Took my Golf R 2024 for a full detailing and it came out better than when it was new. Bryan is super meticulous and he walk you through the whole process/products used. I would recommend Bryan and Royal Prestige to everyone! By far the best auto detailing out there!",
        "time": 1761146766,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Joash John",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/118016115967371793744/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJb1EU2Y6X1JKjiuZOySP-w8LdlxoUYdlf2puvo43FgPW2ZoQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "3 months ago",
        "text": "I bought a used SUV whose previous owner was a smoker and I wanted that smell gone. I brought in my SUV to Bryan who did a great job, it looks brand new and I'm reviewing this a month later and the smoke odor is still gone! Fantastic job highly recommend!",
        "time": 1760997843,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Marguerite Lacelle",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/102662414612905820508/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL8YrNpKg0_m9onM17cwjNveNElAJxyfUEPq6KMRsZgtOPICQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "I highly  recommend this place! I bought a used car and the smell of cigarette smoke was unbearable. I took it to Royal Prestige Auto Detailing and Bryan, the owner, walked me through the process and products he uses for that treatment. He did an amazing job, I didn't recognize the car when I picked it up, it looked brand new inside and out!! 90% of the smell was already gone! Customer service that Bryan gives is next level!!! He is so kind and meticulous in his work, he was also very accommodating to my schedule. His courtesy car was  very much appreciated and, yes, it was spotless :) !!! Thank you so much Bryan, I will be back!!",
        "time": 1767232074,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Authentic Reviews",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/117763140331615655843/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWlffrh3LGGSf22z1NDdAaoXZ7p7kUE3Y6kgTHhZ5oVbuw4OBWZ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 months ago",
        "text": "Where do I start? I dropped off my motorcycle unannounced, and Bryan, the owner, came and gave me the best customer service I have ever received. Super professional, super friendly Highly recommend this shop to anyone. Top-notch service. This place is a gem.",
        "time": 1764098009,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Carsten Crooks",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/108223081644788935956/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXHDsZC6Govgzvr9wX9agn_Efy1CfARfa0OuFXDtpTxx3GN_UXGMQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
